{"id":"n71474-1-8","stage":2,"title":"태우다 · 承载","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71474-1-8-1","ko":"그 차에 우리도 탈 수 있어?","zh":"那辆车我们也能坐进去吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그","meaning":"那样，那个","explanation":"그：那样，那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62250","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"차에","meaning":"车，车辆","explanation":"차：车，车辆；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"차","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62525","senseId":"1","lemma":"차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우리도","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"탈","meaning":"乘，乘坐","explanation":"타다：乘，乘坐；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那样，那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"62250","definition":"指代前面已经讲过或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"6ccd3f82b0317e51","term":"차","zh":"车，车辆","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3","entryId":"62525","definition":"搬运人或行李的带轮